Excel to Outlook Desktop GUI Application - v3.6 STREAMLINED VERSION
Enhanced with intelligent sheet linking and conditional screenshot capture

VERSION 3.6 UPDATES:
1. Added threshold range support (between x and y)
2. Streamlined main interface (removed feature highlights)
3. Simplified popup window (removed threshold UI, kept only To/CC/BCC)
4. Auto-delete files by default after drafting
